  "prefLabel": "Env-C 202.07 License",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-C 202.07 “License” means “license” as defined by RSA 541-A:1, VIII, namely “the whole or part of any agency permit, certificate, approval, registration, charter or similar form of permission required by law.” The term includes any waiver issued under the applicable statute or rules, whether or not the waiver is explicitly incorporated into a license.\n\nSource. #8851-A, eff 3-25-07; ss by #12902-A, eff 10-22-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-c200.html"
